\ MULTASK.SEQ  The cooperative multitasker (SRC/MULTASK.SEQ) on the VM.
AUTOEDITOFF
FLOAD MULTASK.SEQ
0 VALUE COUNTS
BACKGROUND: COUNTER  BEGIN  PAUSE  INCR> COUNTS  AGAIN ;
COUNTER WAKE  MULTI
: SPIN  1000 0 DO PAUSE LOOP ;
SPIN
CR .( counts: ) COUNTS .  .( multi: ) ?MULTI .
COUNTER SLEEP  SPIN  COUNTS  SPIN COUNTS = .( slept: ) .
SINGLE .( single: ) ?MULTI .
0 VALUE HITS
BACKGROUND: T3  BEGIN PAUSE 5 0 DO INCR> HITS PAUSE LOOP STOP AGAIN ;
T3 WAKE MULTI SPIN SINGLE CR .( hits: ) HITS .
CR
